7.000: (goto-fridge robot1 Fridge) [1.000]
8.000: (open-fridge robot1 Fridge) [1.000]
9.000: (put-potato-in-fridge robot1 potato Fridge) [1.000]
10.000: (close-fridge robot1 Fridge) [1.000]
